---
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<section id="disenos" class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center mb-14">
    <div class="mb-3 inline-block rounded-full border border-[#4928C2]/40 bg-[#0B0D12] px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#E3D9FC] uppercase">
      Ingeniería Inversa (REA) · Identidad Propia por Rubro
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-outfit text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#F8F6FF] sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">
      Más de 10 arquitecturas visuales exclusivas. <span class="text-[#BF40FA]">Cero páginas clonadas.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base text-[#E3D9FC]/80">
      Analizamos por ingeniería inversa (REA) los sitios de mayor conversión del mundo (como Delta Cafés y estudios europeos) para que tu consultorio o estudio tenga identidad propia, nunca la misma página que otro colega de tu ciudad.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
    {SITE.templateCatalog.map((tpl) => (
      <div class="group relative flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#4928C2]/30 bg-[#0B0D12] p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#BF40FA]/60 hover:shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(73,40,194,0.2)]">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-outfit text-xs font-bold text-[#E3D9FC]/60">#{tpl.id}</span>
            <span
              class={`rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold ${
                tpl.id === "01"
                  ? "bg-[#BF40FA] text-[#F8F6FF]"
                  : "border border-[#4928C2]/40 bg-[#040607] text-[#E3D9FC]"
              }`}
            >
              {tpl.status}
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-3 font-outfit text-lg font-bold text-[#F8F6FF]">{tpl.name}</h3>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#BF40FA]">{tpl.niche}</p>
          <p class="mt-2.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#E3D9FC]/75">{tpl.description}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#4928C2]/20 pt-3">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-medium text-[#E3D9FC]/60">Tokens de color</span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            {tpl.palette.map((hex) => (
              <span
                class="h-4 w-4 rounded-full border border-white/20"
                style={`background-color: ${hex};`}
                title={hex}
              />
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>
